<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>{% include "head.njk" %}</head>
<body>
{% include "nav.njk" %}
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero shell" id="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cybersecurity student · Builder · Researcher</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Rajwinder<br /><em>Singh Mankoo</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">Building security labs. Investigating real signals.<br class="desktop-break" /> Working toward better defense.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-red" href="#labs">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/resume/">View résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/security-laptop-v2-1100.webp" srcset="/assets/security-laptop-v2-640.webp 640w, /assets/security-laptop-v2-1100.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 46vw" width="1100" height="1100" fetchpriority="high" alt="" /></div>
  </section>

  <section id="labs" class="section shell work-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">c0mpl1cated.labs</p><h2 id="work-title">Built. Tested.<br /><em>Documented.</em></h2><p>Hands-on security work, with the decisions and troubleshooting left in.</p></div>
    <article class="case-feature">
      <div class="case-visual">
        <div class="visual-heading"><span>Wazuh SIEM</span><span class="mono">Deployment study</span></div>
        <div class="case-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore the deployment" hidden>
          <button role="tab" id="architecture-tab" aria-controls="architecture-panel" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">Architecture</button>
          <button role="tab" id="validation-tab" aria-controls="validation-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Validation</button>
          <button role="tab" id="lessons-tab" aria-controls="lessons-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Lessons</button>
        </div>
        <div id="architecture-panel" class="case-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="architecture-tab" tabindex="0">
          <h3 class="panel-title">From endpoint to investigation</h3>
          <ol class="architecture-flow">
            <li><span class="flow-number">01</span><div><strong>Linux workload</strong><span>Agent collects host activity</span></div></li>
            <li><span class="flow-number">02</span><div><strong>Wazuh manager + indexer</strong><span>Process, correlate, and store events</span></div></li>
            <li><span class="flow-number">03</span><div><strong>Threat Hunting dashboard</strong><span>Inspect events and ATT&amp;CK mappings</span></div></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="panel-footnote">Proxmox host · Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS<br />4 vCPU / 8 GB RAM / 80 GB disk</p>
        </div>
        <div id="validation-panel" class="case-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="validation-tab" tabindex="0">
          <h3 class="panel-title">The first 24 hours of signal</h3>
          <dl class="validation-numbers"><div><dt>Total events</dt><dd>57</dd></div><div><dt>Authentication successes</dt><dd>5</dd></div><div><dt>Critical alerts</dt><dd>0</dd></div></dl>
          <p>Default rules mapped activity to <strong>Sudo and Sudo Caching</strong> and <strong>Valid Accounts</strong>.</p>
          <p class="panel-footnote">Recorded in the August 1, 2026 writeup.<br />Historical results, not a live feed.</p>
        </div>
        <div id="lessons-panel" class="case-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="lessons-tab" tabindex="0">
          <h3 class="panel-title">Two bugs. Two useful habits.</h3>
          <ol class="lesson-list"><li><strong>Check the downloaded file.</strong><p>A version placeholder returned an XML error instead of the installer.</p></li><li><strong>Read the component’s own log.</strong><p>The agent was connected. The dashboard needed a refresh.</p></li></ol>
          <p class="panel-footnote">The writeup includes the commands, symptoms, and reasoning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-story">
        <span class="project-kind">Homelab / Security monitoring</span>
        <h3>Standing up a SIEM<br />from nothing.</h3>
        <p>A single-node Wazuh deployment, from storage decisions on an unfamiliar hypervisor to real agent logs and ATT&amp;CK mapping.</p>
        <dl class="project-facts"><div><dt>My work</dt><dd>Deployment, troubleshooting, validation</dd></div><div><dt>Stack</dt><dd>Proxmox · Ubuntu · Wazuh</dd></div><div><dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Live log ingestion validated</dd></div></dl>
        <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/writeups/project-01-wazuh-siem/">Read the complete case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <details class="roadmap"><summary><span>Next in the lab</span><span class="summary-meta">4 planned projects <b aria-hidden="true">+</b></span></summary><div class="roadmap-grid">{% for lab in labs %}{% if lab.statusClass == 'status-pending' %}<article><span class="mono">Not started</span><h3>{{ lab.name | replace(' — ', ' / ') }}</h3><p>{{ lab.description }}</p></article>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></details>
    <div class="lab-social"><div><h3>The lab, in progress.</h3><p>I share lab content at <strong>c0mpl1cated.labs</strong>, with posts designed in Figma.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.instagram }}">Visit the Instagram journal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section shell about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-heading"><h2 id="about-title">Behind<br /><em>the work.</em></h2><p class="about-caption">Cybersecurity at Southern Utah University.<br />Minor in Computer Science.</p></div>
    <div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">I’m learning how systems fail, how to investigate them, and how to build better defenses.</p><p>My focus is detection engineering and purple-team operations. I build enterprise-style labs, compete in CTFs, and turn the work into documentation others can follow.</p><p>Alongside my studies, I support students and staff on SUU’s IT Help Desk and develop challenges with BSides Salt Lake City. My research spans privacy-preserving quantum computing and AI.</p><div id="education" class="education-note"><h3>Southern Utah University</h3><p>B.S. Cybersecurity · Minor in Computer Science</p><span class="mono">August 2023 – April 2027 · Expected graduation</span></div></div>
  </section>

  <section id="experience" class="section shell experience-section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="experience-title">Where I’ve<br /><em>put it to work.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="experience-list">{% for role in profile.experience %}<details class="experience-item" {% if loop.index <= 2 %}open{% endif %}><summary><div><h3>{{ role.title }}</h3><p>{{ role.meta }}</p></div><span class="expand-sign" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="experience-body"><p>{{ role.description }}</p><ul class="inline-tools" aria-label="Skills used">{% for tag in role.tags %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></details>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills" class="section shell skills-section" aria-labelledby="skills-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="skills-title">A practical<br /><em>toolkit.</em></h2><p>The tools I work with across security, infrastructure, and code.</p></div><div class="skills-grid">{% for group in profile.skills %}<div class="skill-group"><h3>{{ group.title }}</h3><p>{{ group.tools | join(' · ') }}</p></div>{% endfor %}</div></section>

  <section id="publications" class="section shell research-section" aria-labelledby="research-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Published research</p><h2 id="research-title">Security beyond<br /><em>the lab.</em></h2></div><div class="research-list">{% for paper in profile.publications %}<article class="research-item"><div class="research-meta"><span class="mono">{% if loop.first %}Springer · 2026{% else %}De Gruyter · 2025{% endif %}</span><span>Book chapter</span></div><div><h3><a href="{{ paper.url }}">{{ paper.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p>{{ paper.description }}</p><details class="citation"><summary>Publication &amp; authors</summary><p>{{ paper.authors }}</p><p>{{ paper.publication }}</p></details></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>

  <section id="writeups" class="section shell journal-section" aria-labelledby="journal-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="journal-title">Notes from<br /><em>the process.</em></h2><p>What worked, what broke, and what I learned.</p></div>{% for post in collections.writeups %}<a class="journal-entry" href="{{ post.url }}"><span class="mono">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><span class="journal-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p></a>{% endfor %}</section>

  <section class="section shell credentials-section" aria-label="Credentials and achievements">
    <div id="certs"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Credentials.</h2><p>Professional certifications and completed coursework.</p></div><div class="credential-list">{% for cert in profile.certifications %}<article><h3>{{ cert.name }}</h3><p>{{ cert.detail }}</p><span>{{ cert.issuer }}</span></article>{% endfor %}</div><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.linkedin }}">View my LinkedIn profile <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div id="achievements" class="achievements"><h2>Recognition.</h2>{% for achievement in profile.achievements %}<article><h3>{{ achievement.detail }}</h3><p>{{ achievement.name }}</p><span>{{ achievement.issuer }}</span></article>{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section shell contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><p class="eyebrow">Open to opportunities &amp; collaboration</p><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s talk<br /><em>security.</em></h2><div class="contact-bottom"><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/assets/rajwinder-mankoo-resume.pdf" download>Download résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></section>
</main>
{% include "footer.njk" %}
</body></html>
